<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Emmis cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Emmis cut on price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs downgraded Emmis Broadcasting Corp to market outperform from the firm's recommended list based on Emmis's stock price, a Goldman source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3-1/16 to 47-1/2.</p>
</text>
